{"seq":1,"slug":"software-testing","title":"软件测试","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/software-engineering/software-testing","wordCount":1103,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"软件测试\">软件测试</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>软件测试是保障产品质量的最后一道防线，也是贯穿开发全流程的质量工程活动。高职软件技术专业的测试课程从测试理论出发，经过用例设计方法，到自动化测试工具实战，让学生具备独立承担测试工程师岗位的能力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"测试基础理论\">测试基础理论</h3><p>软件测试的本质是通过有限的测试用例发现尽可能多的缺陷。测试金字塔模型描述了各层测试的比例关系：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[&quot;端到端测试 (E2E)&lt;br/&gt;数量少,成本高&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;集成测试&lt;br/&gt;验证模块间交互&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;单元测试&lt;br/&gt;数量多,执行快&quot;]\">graph TB\n    A[\"端到端测试 (E2E)&lt;br/&gt;数量少,成本高\"] --&gt; B[\"集成测试&lt;br/&gt;验证模块间交互\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"单元测试&lt;br/&gt;数量多,执行快\"]</pre><p>测试分类维度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>按阶段</strong>：单元测试 → 集成测试 → 系统测试 → 验收测试</li>\n<li><strong>按方法</strong>：黑盒测试（关注输入输出）、白盒测试（关注内部逻辑）</li>\n<li><strong>按目的</strong>：功能测试、性能测试、安全测试、兼容性测试</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"测试用例设计方法\">测试用例设计方法</h3><p><strong>等价类划分</strong>将输入域划分为若干等价类，每类中取一个代表值即可：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输入条件</th>\n<th>有效等价类</th>\n<th>无效等价类</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>年龄（1-150）</td>\n<td>[1, 150]</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>150</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 150</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span></span></span></span></span>, 非数字</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户名（2-20字符）</td>\n<td>&quot;zhangsan&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;a&quot;, 21个字符, 空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>邮箱</td>\n<td>&quot;<a href=\"mailto:a@b.com\">a@b.com</a>&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;abc&quot;, &quot;@.com&quot;, 空</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>边界值分析</strong>在等价类边界取值：对于范围 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>150</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[1, 150]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，测试点为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>149</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>150</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>151</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0, 1, 2, 149, 150, 151</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">149</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">151</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>判定表法</strong>处理多条件组合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"条件1: 订单金额 &gt; 200&#10;条件2: 会员等级 &gt;= 金牌&#10;条件3: 使用优惠券&#10;&#10;规则1: T T T → 折上折 + 免运费&#10;规则2: T T F → 会员折扣 + 免运费&#10;规则3: T F T → 优惠券减免 + 免运费&#10;规则4: T F F → 仅免运费&#10;...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>条件1: 订单金额 > 200</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>条件2: 会员等级 >= 金牌</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>条件3: 使用优惠券</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>规则1: T T T → 折上折 + 免运费</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>规则2: T T F → 会员折扣 + 免运费</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>规则3: T F T → 优惠券减免 + 免运费</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>规则4: T F F → 仅免运费</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>...</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"黑盒与白盒测试\">黑盒与白盒测试</h3><p>黑盒测试不关心内部实现，只验证输入对应的输出是否符合预期。白盒测试关注代码覆盖率：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>语句覆盖</strong>：每条可执行语句至少执行一次</li>\n<li><strong>分支覆盖</strong>：每个判断的真/假分支至少执行一次</li>\n<li><strong>路径覆盖</strong>：所有可能的执行路径至少走一次</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 白盒测试示例 — 分支覆盖&#10;public String classify(int score) {&#10;    if (score &gt;= 90) return &quot;优秀&quot;;      // 分支1-T&#10;    else if (score &gt;= 60) return &quot;及格&quot;;  // 分支2-T&#10;    else return &quot;不及格&quot;;                 // 分支2-F&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 测试用例：score=95(分支1-T), score=75(分支1-F,2-T), score=40(分支1-F,2-F)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 白盒测试示例 — 分支覆盖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> String </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">classify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"优秀\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 分支1-T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"及格\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 分支2-T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"不及格\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;                 </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 分支2-F</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 测试用例：score=95(分支1-T), score=75(分支1-F,2-T), score=40(分支1-F,2-F)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"selenium-web-自动化测试\">Selenium Web 自动化测试</h3><p>Selenium WebDriver 模拟用户操作浏览器，实现 UI 层的回归测试自动化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"public class LoginTest {&#10;    private WebDriver driver;&#10;&#10;    @BeforeEach&#10;    void setup() {&#10;        driver = new ChromeDriver();&#10;        driver.manage().timeouts().implicitlyWait(Duration.ofSeconds(10));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    void testLoginSuccess() {&#10;        driver.get(&quot;http://localhost:8080/login&quot;);&#10;&#10;        driver.findElement(By.id(&quot;username&quot;)).sendKeys(&quot;admin&quot;);&#10;        driver.findElement(By.id(&quot;password&quot;)).sendKeys(&quot;Admin@123&quot;);&#10;        driver.findElement(By.id(&quot;login-btn&quot;)).click();&#10;&#10;        WebElement welcome = driver.findElement(By.className(&quot;welcome-msg&quot;));&#10;        assertTrue(welcome.getText().contains(&quot;欢迎&quot;));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @AfterEach&#10;    void teardown() {&#10;        driver.quit();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LoginTest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebDriver driver;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BeforeEach</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> setup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        driver </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ChromeDriver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        driver.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">manage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">timeouts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">implicitlyWait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Duration.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ofSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> testLoginSuccess</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        driver.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http://localhost:8080/login\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        driver.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(By.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"username\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sendKeys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"admin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        driver.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(By.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"password\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sendKeys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Admin@123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        driver.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(By.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"login-btn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">click</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        WebElement welcome </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> driver.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(By.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">className</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"welcome-msg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        assertTrue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(welcome.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">contains</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"欢迎\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AfterEach</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> teardown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        driver.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">quit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Page Object 模式将页面元素封装为对象，提升自动化脚本的可维护性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"public class LoginPage {&#10;    private WebDriver driver;&#10;&#10;    @FindBy(id = &quot;username&quot;) private WebElement usernameInput;&#10;    @FindBy(id = &quot;password&quot;) private WebElement passwordInput;&#10;    @FindBy(id = &quot;login-btn&quot;) private WebElement loginButton;&#10;&#10;    public LoginPage(WebDriver driver) {&#10;        this.driver = driver;&#10;        PageFactory.initElements(driver, this);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public DashboardPage login(String user, String pass) {&#10;        usernameInput.sendKeys(user);&#10;        passwordInput.sendKeys(pass);&#10;        loginButton.click();&#10;        return new DashboardPage(driver);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LoginPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebDriver driver;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FindBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"username\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">private</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebElement usernameInput;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FindBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"password\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">private</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebElement passwordInput;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FindBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"login-btn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">private</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebElement loginButton;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LoginPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(WebDriver </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">driver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.driver </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> driver;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        PageFactory.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">initElements</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(driver, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DashboardPage </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">login</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(String </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">user</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, String </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        usernameInput.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sendKeys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        passwordInput.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sendKeys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pass);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        loginButton.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">click</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DashboardPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(driver);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"jmeter-性能测试\">JMeter 性能测试</h3><p>Apache JMeter 模拟高并发场景，评估系统在压力下的表现：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性能指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>参考标准</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TPS</td>\n<td>每秒事务处理数</td>\n<td>业务量决定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均响应时间</td>\n<td>请求到响应的时间</td>\n<td>API <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>200</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 200ms</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>99分位 (P99)</td>\n<td>99% 请求的响应时间</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 1s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误率</td>\n<td>失败请求占比</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 0.1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>JMeter 测试计划的核心组件：线程组（模拟用户数）→ HTTP 请求采样器 → 断言 → 监听器（聚合报告）。压测时逐步加压观察系统拐点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>AI 生成测试用例</strong>：2026 年 Copilot 和专用测试 AI 可根据代码逻辑自动生成单元测试和边界条件，测试工程师角色从&quot;编写用例&quot;转向&quot;设计策略和验证 AI 输出&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Playwright 替代 Selenium</strong>：微软的 Playwright 在跨浏览器自动化、录制回放、网络模拟方面表现更优，逐渐成为新项目首选</li>\n<li><strong>混沌工程</strong>：通过注入故障（网络延迟、服务宕机）验证系统韧性，从测试&quot;功能正确&quot;扩展到测试&quot;故障容忍&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Shift-Left Testing</strong>：测试左移至开发阶段，TDD/BDD 在敏捷团队中更加普及</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>为一个&quot;用户注册&quot;功能设计完整的测试用例集：使用等价类划分和边界值分析方法，覆盖用户名、密码、邮箱、手机号四个输入字段。要求用例数不超过 25 条但覆盖所有关键场景。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>使用 Selenium (或 Playwright) 为一个登录页面编写自动化测试脚本，采用 Page Object 模式，覆盖：正常登录、密码错误、账号锁定三个场景。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>使用 JMeter 对你的 Spring Boot 项目 API 进行压力测试：分别在 50、100、200 并发用户下测试登录接口的 TPS 和响应时间，画出负载-性能曲线，找出系统瓶颈。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>软件测试是工程质量保障的核心手段。测试用例设计方法（等价类、边界值、判定表）提供了系统化发现缺陷的思路；自动化测试工具（Selenium/Playwright）将重复性验证从人力中解放出来；性能测试（JMeter）确保系统在真实负载下仍能稳定运行。&quot;测试思维&quot;不只是测试工程师的专属能力——优秀的开发者同样需要具备质量意识和测试习惯。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"软件测试","id":"软件测试"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"测试基础理论","id":"测试基础理论"},{"level":3,"text":"测试用例设计方法","id":"测试用例设计方法"},{"level":3,"text":"黑盒与白盒测试","id":"黑盒与白盒测试"},{"level":3,"text":"Selenium Web 自动化测试","id":"selenium-web-自动化测试"},{"level":3,"text":"JMeter 性能测试","id":"jmeter-性能测试"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"移动应用开发","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/web-fullstack/mobile-app-development"},"next":{"title":"版本控制与协作","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/software-engineering/version-control-collaboration"}}